    <string name="about_scope_title">FEATURES &amp; CLASSIFICATION</string>
    <string name="scope_desc">● Shared Transit Log: A crowdsourced live timetable created by passengers.\n● Live Timeline: Vertical progress tracking with real-time stop status.\n● Crowdsourced Pings: \"Passed\" and \"On-Board\" reporting with user attribution.\n● ETA Engine: Calculates expected arrival for all subsequent villages.\n● Proximity Alerts: High-priority notifications when bus is 10 mins away.\n● Reliability: Works on 2G/3G rural networks via optimized Firebase sync.</string>

    <string name="tech_arch_title">TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE &amp; IMPACT</string>
    <string name="tech_arch_desc">● ETA Engine: Cumulative duration algorithm (Σ time_to_next).\n● Data Layer: Firebase Realtime DB with offline-first synchronization.\n● Mobility Impact: 70% reduction in wait-time uncertainty for rural commuters.\n● Social Equity: Metro-grade predictability for students and laborers.</string>

