    <string name="post_mvp_desc">● User Reputation: Trust scores based on verified reporting accuracy.\n● GenAI Predictions: ML-driven ETAs using historical ping patterns.\n● Voice Pings: Hands-free reporting for drivers via voice commands.\n● SOS System: One-tap emergency alerts to community contacts.\n● Multilingual: Kannada and local dialect support for accessibility.</string>

